  "text": "Evolution Veterinary Specialists | Emergency & Veterinary Specialty\n720-510-7707\n34 Van Gordon St, Ste. 160\ninfo@evolutionvet.com\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nFacility\nPatient Stories\nCareers\nServices\nPrimary Care\n24-Hour Emergency\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDentistry\nEndoscopy\nInternal Medicine\nOncology\nSurgery\nFluoroscopy\nAnesthesiology and Pain Management\nOphthalmology\nFor Pet Parents\nPayments\nPet Portal\nPharmacy\nVetTriage\nFor Veterinarians\nMobile Cardiology\nContact\nResources\nThe Zelda Fund\nIntake Forms\nBlood Bank\nCardiac Resources\nFinancial Resources\nInfo Flyers\nBlog\nVetTriage\nSearch for:\nSearch Button\nThank You for Your Patience\nWe are currently in transition to a new scheduling system. Please know that your pet's care is extremely important to us. We appreciate your patience and understanding while we acclimate to our new system.\n24/7 Care For Your\nBest Friend\nContact us\n24-hour Emergency\nPrimary Care\nCritical Care\nOur Specialties\nCardiology\nInternal Medicine\nOncology\nSurgery\nBlood Bank\nOphthalmology in partnership with Apex\nOur Hospital\nEvolution Veterinary Specialists started in 2019 as a way to bring high-quality, personalized veterinary care to Lakewood. Our facility is constantly being updated and improved with new technology. Our treatment area has everything needed for emergencies and more such as surgery, endoscopy and other specialty services.\nLearn more about EVS\nThe Zelda Fund\nYour generosity in supporting the Zelda Fund not only saves lives but also celebrates the profound role pets play in our daily existence. Our furry companions teach us the essence of unconditional love, loyalty, and the immeasurable joy they bring. Your contribution ensures that this bond remains cherished in countless homes, serving as a testament to the enduring importance of pets in our lives.\nDonate Today\nJoin Our Newsletter\nSubscribe to receive our latest updates in your inbox!\nEmail\nSign Up\nShare Your Experience\nLeave a Review\nContact Us\n720-510-7707\n34 Van Gordon St\nSte. 160\nLakewood, CO 80228\nEmergency Hospital\nOpen 24 hours, 7 days a week\nNo appointments\nVeterinary Specialty Clinic\nOpen Mon-Fri\n9am-5pm\nFollow us\nfacebook\ninstagram\ntwitter\nlinkedin\nyoutube\nAbout Us\nServices\nResources\nCareers\nContact\nPayments\nPet Portal\nPharmacy\nFor Veterinarians\nTerms of Service\nPrivacy & Cookie Policy\n© Copyright 2024 Evolution Veterinary Specialists\n×\nWe are experiencing phone issues, please email us at info@evolutionvet.com!\nEmail Us",
